<!--
  A Live Set for the clip tabs' song tempo (mscore/cliptempo.h), made by a script from a set Live 12.4.6 saved on
  the test VM (2026-10-03; the root element and the whole MainTrack as Live wrote them, Manual tempo 120, the
  Tempo's AutomationTarget Id 841); the tracks cut down to their names and arrangement MIDI clips, and the
  tempo envelope's events (Live wrote only its default event) replaced by these, IN NO SET LIVE MADE (no Live-made
  set with tempo breakpoints was at hand: the events are the format of every other envelope, liveset.h):
    default 120; 0: 120; 8: 120; 16: 150 (a straight ramp); 20: 150 curved (CurveControl 0.5 0 1 0.5) to 28: 90;
    32: 90 and 32: 100 (a jump).
  Tracks: "Violin" (a looping clip at song beats 8-24, loop 0-4, start marker 1; a clip at 32-40 not looping),
  "Bass" (a clip at 0-16), the return track "A-Reverb" (Live's API lists it apart).
-->
